WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
…we don't have the automated horns that go off.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.800
So it is us blowing the horn once we get the Flash weather alert.

3
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:11.100
It's been like 100% dependable for us.

4
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.200
It's one of the best tools we have at our facility, and we use it,

5
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:19.000
members trust us, and it's just been an unbelievable asset for the club.
